<title>UK: SOCCER-CRYSTAL PALACE WIN PROMOTION TO ENGLISH PREMIER LEAGUE.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-CRYSTAL PALACE WIN PROMOTION TO ENGLISH PREMIER LEAGUE.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Crystal Palace will play in the English premier league next season after they beat Sheffield United 1-0 (halftime 0-0) in the first division promotion play-off final at Wembley on Monday.</p>
<p>Scorer: David Hopkin 90</p>
<p>Attendance: 64,383</p>
